                  "content": "收单 = acquiring-service，内含 transaction / checkout / command / client-api 四模块共用一库；Checkout Session 是交易的可选子聚合，Direct Pay 不经 Session。商务 = commercial-service。术语表：Acquiring 仅指 Client 侧收款受理层，不含支付执行与渠道；Payment = 支付执行；Payout = 出款；FX Deal = 兑换；Refund Request = 退款请求；Order 不作为服务名。",
